---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "FRIENDS of SIES funds the programs the district doesn't — the aquariums, the track, the interventionists, the art and music days at Sullivan's Island Elementary."
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero-bg" src="/assets/images/playground-community.jpg" alt="Families and children gathered on a leafy school playground during a community event" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>Friends builds what's&nbsp;possible.</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ site.name }} is the funding engine behind what makes our school exceptional. We're a parent-run organization that raises money for the teachers, programs, and resources the district doesn't pay for — the things that turn a good public school into a remarkable one.</p>
    <p class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ways-to-give/">Give to Grow — Donate</a>
    </p>
    <p class="hero-note">Everyone gets involved. Give whatever you like.</p>
  </div>
  <svg class="hero-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M0,40 C240,70 480,10 720,30 C960,50 1200,20 1440,45 L1440,70 L0,70 Z" fill="#fdfaf5"></path></svg>
</section>

<section class="band band-sand pillars" aria-labelledby="pillars-heading">
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 id="pillars-heading" class="section-title">What your gift becomes</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">FRIENDS funds the programs the district doesn't — the aquariums, the track, the interventionists, the art and music days.</p>
    <div class="pillar-grid">
      {% for pillar in pillars.pillars %}
      <article class="pillar">
        {% if pillar.image %}
        <img class="pillar-img" src="{{ pillar.image }}" alt="{{ pillar.imageAlt }}" loading="lazy">
        {% else %}
        <div class="pillar-img pillar-img-placeholder"><span>photo coming: art &amp; music days</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="pillar-body">
          <h3>{{ pillar.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ pillar.example }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-more"><a href="/what-we-fund/">See everything we fund →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-navy numbers" aria-labelledby="numbers-heading">
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 id="numbers-heading" class="section-title">Our impact, by the numbers</h2>
    <dl class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat"><dt>Raised last year</dt><dd>~$200K</dd></div>
      <div class="stat"><dt>Students served</dt><dd>~500</dd></div>
      <div class="stat"><dt>Per child, per year</dt><dd>~$500</dd></div>
      <div class="stat"><dt>Participation goal</dt><dd>100%</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="fine-print">Figures are approximate, from our 2025–26 year — our strongest since COVID.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-white rhythm" aria-labelledby="rhythm-heading">
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 id="rhythm-heading" class="section-title">A year of giving, together</h2>
    <ol class="season-list">
      {% for event in events.events %}
      <li class="season-item">
        <span class="season-tag">{{ event.season }}</span>
        <strong><a href="/events/#{{ event.slug }}">{{ event.name }}</a></strong>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="section-more"><a href="/events/">Explore the annual calendar →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-mist pta-note" aria-labelledby="pta-heading">
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 id="pta-heading" class="section-title">Wondering how FRIENDS differs from the PTA?</h2>
    <p>PTA creates the experience. FRIENDS creates the impact. Two groups, one amazing school — <a href="/friends-and-pta/">here's the short version</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band-sea closing-cta">
  <svg class="band-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M0,45 C240,15 480,60 720,35 C960,10 1200,55 1440,30 L1440,0 L0,0 Z" fill="#cfe4e2"></path></svg>
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 class="section-title">Join your neighbors in giving</h2>
    <p>{{ site.taxLine }}</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ways-to-give/">Give to Grow — Donate</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
